; The one variable: a GridMap whose MeshLibrary item is an ArrayMesh with a LINES surface, in four cells: the
; first upright, the second turned a half turn about Y, the third and fourth upright, one cell up for the
; fourth. Godot draws the segments at each cell's place. It lights a line, which has no normal array, as a +Z
; normal in node space, and the cell's basis turns it: the sun lights the upright lines and not the turned one.

